claim.claim-text:
performing, by a terminal device, detection (210) of a first signal or channel sent by a network device; and
determining (220) , by the terminal device, whether to detect a second signal or channel according to a detection result of the first signal or channel and a configuration made by the network device, the configuration indicating a relationship between the detection result of the first signal or channel and whether to detect the second signal or channel;
wherein the method further comprises:

determining, by a network device, configuration information, wherein the configuration information is used to indicate a configuration of a relationship between a detection result of a first signal or channel performed by a terminal device and whether to detect a second signal or channel; and
sending , by the network device, the configuration information to the terminal device;
wherein the method further comprises:

the communication unit (410) is configured to detect a first signal or channel sent by a network device; and
the processing unit (420) is configured to determine whether to detect a second signal or channel according to a detection result of the first signal or channel and a configuration made by the network device regarding a relationship between the detection result of the first signal or channel and whether to detect the second signal or channel;
wherein the communication unit (410) is further configured to:

the processing unit (520) is configured to determine configuration information, wherein the configuration information is used to indicate a configuration of a relationship between a detection result of a first signal or channel performed by a terminal device and whether to detect a second signal or channel; and
the communication unit (510) is configured to send the configuration information to the terminal device;
wherein the communication unit (510) is configured to:
